    code: "// Approach: Repeatedly clear the rightmost set bit with n &= n-1. The loop runs once per set bit.\n#include <cstdint>\nusing namespace std;\nint countSetBits(uint32_t n) {\n    int count = 0;\n    // n & (n - 1) removes the lowest set bit each time.\n    while (n) {\n        n &= n - 1;\n        ++count;\n    }\n    return count;\n}",
